        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Fred MacMurray, Rudolph Maté, Charlton Heston, Donna Reed, Barbara Hale\n- Films: The Absent-Minded Professor, The Far Horizons\n- Roles: Professor Ned Brainard\n\nFacts:\n- Fred MacMurray was born on August 30, 1908.\n- Fred MacMurray was an American actor whose career spanned from 1930 to the 1970s.\n- Fred MacMurray appeared in more than 100 movies and a successful television series.\n- The Far Horizons is a 1955 American western film directed by Rudolph Maté and starring Fred MacMurray, Charlton Heston, Donna Reed, and Barbara Hale.\n- In The Absent-Minded Professor, Fred MacMurray starred as Professor Ned Brainard.\n- Fred MacMurray died on November 5, 1991.",
